\par\par \b \uc2  Thailand Baht Ends Stable Despite Shutdown Of 16 Fincl Cos \b0\par\par\uc2 305 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 27 Juni 1997\par 12:56\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BANGKOK (AP-Dow Jones)--The Thai baht finished steady in domestic and offshore spot trading Friday as \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  investors remained cool to a government decision to shut down 16 troubled finance companies. \par \par \uc2  The Thai \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , however, weakened in the swap market, where investors make agreements to buy and sell baht at specified times in the future. Swap premiums rose slightly, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  At the close of Asian trading Friday, the dollar was at 25.87 baht in the domestic market, unchanged from Thursday. The dollar was at 25.55 baht in offshore trading, unchanged from Thursday. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the market's cool reaction reflected an expectation that the Bank of Thailand was likely to lose its patience with wobbly finance companies. On Friday the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  and the finance ministry shut down 16 finance companies and ordered them to merge with five stronger ones. \par \par \uc2  The move marked the toughest action Thai regulators have taken against financial institutions in 14 years. But dealers said it was inevitable because the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was bound to run short of money to prop up troubled institutions indefinitely. Finance Minister Thanong Bidaya said the 16 institutions were chosen because they had borrowed 'too much' from the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  'Investors were expecting this,' a dealer at the Bank of Tokyo said. \par \par \uc2  Despite the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's stability, the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2  had to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  again Friday to defend it. That's because the dollar remained well outside the upper limit of the trading band in which the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  allows it to trade freely against the baht. \par \par \uc2  The band was 25.73 baht to 25.77 baht Friday. The mid-rate was 25.75 baht, compared with 25.77 baht Thursday. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 27-06-97 \par \par \uc2  1056GMT \par \par \uc2  1028 1861 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt6r04n1j\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
