\par\par \b \uc2  Thailand Baht Higher Mid-Morning On  \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank \highlight\uc2 's Buying \b0\par\par\uc2 328 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 23 Juni 1997\par 04:47\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BANGKOK (AP-Dow Jones)--The Thai baht is recovering against the dollar in early domestic trading Monday on buying by the country's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 . It is however expected to drop later on a round of selling by investors worried about the new finance minister's ability to tackle economic woes, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The Thai \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  is weakening in the swap market, where investors make agreements to buy and sell dollars at specified times in the future. Swap premiums are rising as corporate clients accumulate dollars to hedge against what dealers described as an increasing devaluation risk. \par \par \uc2  Around 0220 GMT (10:20 p.m. EDT Sunday), the dollar is at 25.975 baht in the domestic spot market, down from 26.20 baht Friday. In the offshore market, the dollar is at 25.45 baht, slightly below 25.50 baht Friday. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the baht is recovering in the domestic market as the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  sells dollars to prop it up. But the Thai \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  remains under downward pressure as investors shifted to the dollar following the resignation of Finance Minister Amnuay Viravan last week, dealers said. The appointment of Thanong Bidaya, president of Thai Military Bank PCL (P.TMB), to replace Amnuay, failed to impress investors, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  'Thanong doesn't have the kind of profile Amnuay has in the foreign community,' said a dealer at a U.S. bank in Bangkok. 'Nobody thinks he can be as good as Amnuay.' \par \par \uc2  The dollar's rate in the spot market remains within the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  band, indicating that the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2  is spending its reserves to prop up the Thai \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , dealers said. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  set its daily mid-rate at 25.81 baht, up from 25.79 baht Friday. The \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  band is set between 25.79 baht and 25.83 baht. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 23-06-97 \par \par \uc2  0247GMT \par \par \uc2  1028 1861 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt6n04ohl\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
