\par\par \b \uc2  Thai Baht/Profit/Forwards -2: Big Losses Sustained By Some \b0\par\par\uc2 318 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 16 Mai 1997\par 13:58\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  Views differed among traders over the likely size of losses taken by banks on their Thai baht spot and swap positions after Thursday's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2  and other Asian central banks to support the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The BoT's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  drove spot rates from a low of 26.38 baht/dollar on Wednesday to open at 25.50 baht/dollar on Friday. The rate has since fallen back to 25.83 baht late on Friday. \par \par \uc2  'Some of the big interbank players have been crucified in the swaps market,' said one trader, explaining that banks with swap positions had been hard hit when the Bank of Thailand pushed up short term money rates to punish speculators with short spot positions in the baht. That put the cost of borrowing baht to exorbitant levels. \par \par \uc2  Thailand's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  declared early Friday that the speculative attack on the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  was over. Chaiyawat Wibulswasdi, the bank's deputy governor, said speculators who sold the baht short this week need to be punished and urged Thai banks to charge such investors premiums of more than 1,000% as they rush to buy baht to settle positions. \par \par \uc2  But some traders played down the size of possible losses, however. \par \par \uc2  'The losers are U.S. hedge funds and bank proprietary traders who speculated against the baht without covering themselves in the forward market,' said a trader at a leading U.S. investment bank in Singapore. \par \par \uc2  'Lots of people have lost in excess of $100,000 and there is a sphere of people who have lost in excess of $1 million, but I do not believe any one has lost $5 million or more,' \par \par \uc2  A number of smaller U.S. hedge funds closed their short baht positions after taking moderate losses, say traders. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 16-05-97 \par \par \uc2  1158GMT \par \par \uc2  1143 4205 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt5g03i7i\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
