\par\par \b \uc2  FOCUS - Thai  \highlight22\uc2 central bank \highlight\uc2  says baht returning to normal. \b0\par\par\uc2  By Anchalee Koetsawang \par \uc2 508 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 16 Mai 1997\par 07:55\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1997 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  BANGKOK, May 16 (Reuter) - Thailand's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said on Friday that speculative attacks on the baht had ended and the situation for the embattled \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  was returning to normal. \par \par \uc2  "Since yesterday there has been no speculation (in the baht). If there is any speculation we will do our duty (\b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 )," Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2  deputy governor Chaiyawat Wibulswasdi said. \par \par \uc2  "The speculation in the baht has stopped, judging from the level the baht is trading against the dollar in the market compared with the midrate," Chaiyawat said. \par \par \uc2  "Investor thinking is now on the reverse side. They are now buying the baht because they know it is not worth speculating," he added. \par \par \uc2  Attacks on the baht by foreign speculators this week forced swap rates to soar, sparked heavy Thai and other regional \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to keep the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  from sliding and sent shockwaves through the Thai stock market, which fell to near eight-year lows. \par \par \uc2  However, \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealers said on Friday that they had noted selling of dollars for the baht in the spot market by those seeking to ease their tight baht liquidity. \par \par \uc2  At 0543 GMT, the baht was weaker at 25.800/900 against 25.300/340 late on Thursday. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  fixed the midrate at 25.82 versus the dollar. \par \par \uc2  Chaiyawat also made clear that foreign speculators who sold the baht heavily for U.S. dollars would have to pay a high price for their action by buying back the baht from the more expensive swap market to square outstanding positions. \par \par \uc2  "We separate local investors from outside speculators in terms of liquidity supply. The outside speculators cannot buy baht back to meet obligations through regular channels. For Thai business, everything will be normal," he said. \par \par \uc2  "The speculators must pay the price. Because of their speculative move, the swap premiums soared. If they intend to buy from the forward market like that, they must buy through the swap market," he added. \par \par \uc2  Local \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealers confirmed that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had told them not to buy dollars from offshore punters to fight against further speculation. \par \par \uc2  "We were informally informed (by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) not to buy dollars from offshore players," said a dealer. \par \par \uc2  Chaiyawat said he expected liquidity and the overnight interbank rate in the local money market to be tight on Friday but added that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was ready to help ease and calm the situation. \par \par \uc2  "Today liquidity will be tight. But the Bank of Thailand will ensure that those with liquidity problems will be helped," he added. \par \par \uc2  The local interbank rate jumped to 20-22 percent early on Friday from 14-15 percent late on Thursday as liquidity tightened while demand for baht rose and the baht/dollar swap premiums rocketed to around 70-100 satangs, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  Thailand has been dogged by investor jitters because of its sluggish economy which is expected to grow at just over five percent this year -- the lowest in a decade. \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1997 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011002dt5g05gxu\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
