\par\par \b \uc2  Thailand ready to fight new baht attacks - report. \b0\par\par\uc2 320 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 16 Mai 1997\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1997 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  BANGKOK, May 16 (Reuter) - Thailand will be alert against any fresh speculative attacks on the ailing baht after its effective defence of the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  this week, \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  governor Rerngchai Marakanond said. \par \par \uc2  Rerngchai told the Nation newspaper in an interview on Thursday that his bank was prepared to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets and would seek cooperation, if necessary, from other regional central banks to do the job. \par \par \uc2  "The baht volatility has been going on for several days, but we decided to fight the battle in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets so that we did not have to defend the baht at home," he said. \par \par \uc2  Rerngchai said: "If necessary, we'll also ask for cooperation from other countries. You've got to understand that the speculators follow no ethical codes...in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets there is no world police." \par \par \uc2  "Now the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  rates fall within the band which we try to maintain, but we cannot be careless," he said. \par \par \uc2  The governor declined to say how much Thailand had used to defend the baht on Wednesday but dealers estimated the country spent billions of dollars to shore up its \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The baht fell to 26.330/26.440 to the dollar early on Wednesday before the Thai \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  which helped the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  close sharply firmer at 25.910/25.940. \par \par \uc2  At 0341 GMT on Friday it was quoted at 25.450/25.650. \par \par \uc2  Rerngchai said \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  speculators had underestimated a joint defence mechanism that Thailand has with 11 regional countries. "We have informed the speculators all along that this cooperation exists, but they say the cooperation is only on paper." \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2  said it defended the baht on Wednesday through concerted \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  carried out with the \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  of Singapore. Other regional banks were also suspected to have been buying the Thai \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .-- Bangkok newsroom (662)-6520642 \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1997 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011002dt5g05ges\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
