\par\par \b \uc2  Thailand/ \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank \highlight\uc2 /Speculators-2: 'They've Given Up' \b0\par\par\uc2 256 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 15 Mai 1997\par 10:08\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BANGKOK (AP-Dow Jones)--Speculators who on Wednesday launched one of the most severe attacks on the Thai \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  in years are now selling dollars frantically, having been stung by \b \highlight22\uc2 central-bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , a senior offical at the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2  said Thursday. \par \par \uc2  'I think speculators have unwound their positions,' said the official, who is familiar with the bank's money-market \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2 , told Dow Jones Newswires. 'It means they've given up. They're probably selling dollars now, which is why the baht is trading so high.' \par \par \uc2  The dollar, which closed Wednesday 0.46 baht outside the upper limit of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's trading range, is now trading 0.14 baht outside the lower limit of the range. The range is 25.79 baht to 25.83 baht. Around 0757 GMT (3:57 EDT), the dollar is trading at 25.65 baht. \par \par \uc2  When the baht is outside the upper limit of the range, it means the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is selling dollars to defend the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . When it is outside the lower limit, it means the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has to buy dollars to defend the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  official said, however, that the Bank of Thailand doesn't want the baht to be outside the lower limit of the range, either. 'I'm very concerned about this, he said. He declined to say, however, whether he expects the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  to return within the band by Friday. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 15-05-97 \par \par \uc2  0808GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt5f03evs\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
