\par\par \b \uc2  Thai Baht/Volatilities Soar -2: Spot Market Steadies \b0\par\par\uc2 259 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 15 Mai 1997\par 07:32\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  'Everyone is standing on the sidelines, waiting to see if the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2  is prepared to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to support the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 ,' said another Singapore-based trader. \par \par \uc2  The increased volatility of the baht had a spill-over effect on other regional \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 . Volatilities implied by the prices of short-dated options on the Malaysian ringitt and the Indonesian rupiah also rose, as the volume of options traded in the market slackened, traders said. \par \par \uc2  In the spot market, the Thai baht moves back into the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  band, indicating the bank's efforts to fend off speculators on the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  are yielding results. It has since moved out of the strong end of the band. \par \par \uc2  Around 0530 GMT, the dollar is trading at 25.767 baht, outside the bottom end of the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  band of 25.79 to 25.83 baht. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is obligated to buy or sell dollars at below-market rates whenever the dollar moves outside that range. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said, however, that the crisis is far from over despite \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2  in concert with the Singapore \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  Swap rates have surged to their highest levels in several years, indicating nervousness in overseas markets about the outlook for the baht over the next 12 months. Investors in the swap market make agreements to buy and sell dollars at specified times in the future. The rates touched their highest levels since February. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 15-05-97 \par \par \uc2  0532GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt5f03dhc\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
