\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Thailand \highlight\uc2 /Baht/ \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  Band -2: Swap Rates Still Surge \b0\par\par\uc2 335 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 15 Mai 1997\par 06:33\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BANGKOK (AP-Dow Jones)--The Thai baht is once more trading within the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  band, indicating the bank's efforts to fend off a speculative attack on the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  are yielding results. \par \par \uc2  Around 0415 GMT (12:15 EDT), the dollar is trading at 25.825 baht, within the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  band of 25.79 to 25.83 baht. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is obligated to buy or sell dollars at below-market rates whenever the dollar moves outside that range. \par \par \uc2  'It looks like the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  is working at last,' a dealer at the Bank of Tokyo said. Following a speculative attack on the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  that drove the baht to a low of more than seven years Wednesday, the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in concert with Singapore's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to defend the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . The government said Thursday it would also seek Japanese aid. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said, however, that the crisis is still far from over. Swap rates have surged to their highest levels in several years, indicating nervousness in overseas markets about the outlook for the baht over the next 12 months. Investors in the swap market make agreements to buy and sell dollars at specified times in the future. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par At 4:15 GMT, swap rates are as follows, in satang (100 satang equals 1\par baht). The rates were the highest since February.\par        Thursday    Wednesday   Tuesday     Monday\par 1 mo   90.0-110.0  23.0-26.0   6.75-7.25   6.0-6.25\par 2 mo   100.0-110.0 35.0-39.0   12.75-13.5  11.75-12.0\par 3 mo   120.0-125.0 45.0-50.0   19.0-19.25  17.75-18.25\par 6 mo   140.0-145.0 67.0-69.0   38.0-38.5   35.5-36.5\par 1 yr   200.0-210.0 110-115.0   77.0-79.0   73.5-75.0\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 15-05-97\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 0433GMT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt5f03d8j\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
