\par\par \b \uc2  Thai baht firmer, interbank rate jumps late. \b0\par\par\uc2 214 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 13 Mai 1997\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1997 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  BANGKOK, May 13 (Reuter) - The Thai baht was stronger against the dollar near the close on Tuesday on talk of possible \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in offshore markets to defend the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , dealers said. \par \par \uc2  Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2  official were not available for comment on the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  talk. \par \par \uc2  The baht rose to 25.900/25.910 in late trade from 25.935/25.945 in early morning, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  "There was very heavy selling of the dollar in the afternoon. There was talk of \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , but I can not confirm it," said one dealer at a foreign bank. \par \par \uc2  Some players were also seen arbitraging by buying dollars from the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  at a lower level than the interbank spot rate and then selling it to the market, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The Bank of Thailand fixed the mid-rate at 25.88 per dollar against 25.85 on Monday. \par \par \uc2  The overnight interbank rate rose to 11.00-12.00 percent late from 9.50-10.00 percent early as banks borrowed funds to speculate on the dollar, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The one-month baht/dollar swap premium was quoted at 6.25/7.25 satangs per dollar against 6.00/7.00 earlier. \par \par \uc2  -- Anuchit Nguyen (662) 652-0642 \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1997 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011002dt5d05r78\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
