\par\par \b \uc2  Bank of  \highlight22\uc2 Thailand intervenes \highlight\uc2  to sell dollars. \b0\par\par\uc2 266 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 9 Mai 1997\par 05:16\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1997 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  SINGAPORE, May 9 (Reuter) - The Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in Singapore \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets on Friday to sell dollars at 26.025 baht after the Thai unit came under intense pressure on rumours it denied of a band widening, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The baht was quoted at 26.012/26.017 to the dollar at 0330 GMT after falling as low as 26.090 earlier, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  They said the Thai \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had also \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  earlier in the swap market, offering the six-month and one-year swaps. \par \par \uc2  The rumours, that the Thai \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  planned to widen the dollar/baht trading band, emerged in London markets overnight and prompted a sell-off in the baht. \par \par \uc2  "A lot of U.S. investment houses were trying to attack the baht and buy dollars yesterday and it's been quite hectic today as well," a U.S. bank dealer said. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the baht had calmed down somewhat after the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's denial of the rumour and its \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . But the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  was still trading well above Friday's mid-rate of 25.99 per dollar. \par \par \uc2  "We should trade between 26.000 and 26.030 for the rest of the day," another dealer said. \par \par \uc2  Paiboon Kittisrikangwan, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's division chief in charge of money and \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets, told Reuters the Bank of Thailand had no plan to change the exchange rate mechanism. \par \par \uc2  "Rumours about any change in the exchange rate mechanism, including band-widening, are utter nonsense," he said. \par \par \uc2  -- Singapore newsroom (65-8703080) \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1997 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011002dt5905uro\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
