k rates were unchanged. Both the overnight and call rates closed at 9%-9.5% \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 07-05-97 \par \par \uc2  1119GMT \par \par \uc2  1028 1861 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt57034x3\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
