\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Thailand \highlight\uc2 /Baht Rebounds Late -2: No  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  Seen \b0\par\par\uc2 257 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 9 April 1997\par 13:33\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  Dealers said that any downward pressure the downgrade news had on the Thai \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  was brief as investors had prepared themselves for such news since Moody's cut Thailand's short-term debt rating in September. As a result, the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market wasn't seen at all Wednesday, they said. \par \par \uc2  'There was no point for the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 ,' said a dealer at a U.S. bank in Bangkok. 'The dollar rose against the yen and then corrected itself. That alone was good enough a reason for the baht to rebound.' \par \par \uc2  In downgrading Thailand's ratings, Moody's cited mounting short-term foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  debts, the declining competitiveness of Thailand's traditional manufactured export industries, the government's inability to respond to constraints in macro-economic policies, and the health of Thailand's financial system and its property sector. \par \par \uc2  The downgrade came eight weeks after Moody's placed the credit ratings of Thailand and five commercial banks on review for a possible downgrade on Feb. 14. All bonds and deposit ratings of five banks were also downgraded to A3 from A2, in conjunction with the agency's decision to cut the sovereign rating. The five banks are Bangkok Bank PCL (P.BBK), the Export-Import (EXIM) Bank of Thailand, the Industrial Finance Corp of Thailand PCL (H.IFC), Siam Commercial Bank PCL (P.SBK), and Thai Farmers Bank PCL (P.TFB). \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 09-04-97 \par \par \uc2  1133GMT \par \par \uc2  1028 1861 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt4902icw\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
