\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Thailand \highlight\uc2 /Baht Tumbles -2:  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  Caps Dollar's Rise \b0\par\par\uc2 261 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 9 April 1997\par 05:48\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  Dealers said investors dumped the baht in reaction to the announcement that Moody's Investors Service has downgraded Thailand's foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  ceilings for bonds and bank deposits to A3 from A2. As a result, all credit ratings for Thailand's bonds have been downgraded to A3 as well. \par \par \uc2  In downgrading Thailand's ratings, Moody's cited mounting short-term foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  debts, the declining competitiveness of Thailand's traditional manufactured export industries, the constraints in macroeconomic policies and the government's disposal to respond to these challenges, and the health of Thailand's financial system and its property sector. The downgrade came eight weeks after Moody's placed the credit ratings of Thailand and five commercial banks on review for a possible downgrade on Feb. 14. \par \par \uc2  The dollar's rise against the baht, however, is capped by the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  band, in which the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  allows the dollar to trade versus the baht. At the midrate of 26.08 baht Wednesday, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  keeps the dollar within the band of 26.06 baht and 26.10 baht, obliging itself to \b \highlight22\uc2 interven\b0 \highlight\uc2  when the dollar moves outside of thie band. \par \par \uc2  But the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's daily \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in local spot market is schduled to end at 0530 GMT (1:30 a.m. EDT), dealers said. As a result, the dollar may be allowed to rise freely against the baht later in the afternoon session, they said. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 09-04-97 \par \par \uc2  0348GMT \par \par \uc2  1028 1861 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt4902fnw\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
