\par\par \b \uc2  Thailand: Baht Falls Late As Dollar Rises Against Yen \b0\par\par\uc2 235 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 8 April 1997\par 13:05\par \uc2  Dow Jones Asian Equities Report \par \uc2 AER\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BANGKOK (Dow Jones)--The Thai baht fell against the dollar in Asian spot trading Tuesday, suffering from the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's ascent against the Japanese yen, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The Thai \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , however, strengthened in the swap market where investors agree to buy and sell dollars at specified times in the future. Dealers said this shows demand for the dollar isn't likely to be maintained in the medium-to-long term. \par \par \uc2  At the close of spot trading, the dollar was at 26.093 baht, up from its last close of 25.977 baht on Friday. The Thai market was closed for a holiday Monday. \par \par \uc2  At that rate the dollar fell within the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  range. If the dollar falls outside the band of 26.04 baht to 26.08 baht, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is obliged to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market. \par \par \uc2  The Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2  fixed its dollar-baht midrate at 26.06 baht Tuesday, up from 25.94 baht. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the baht fell against the dollar because of the U.S. unit's rise against the Japanese yen. The baht is pegged to a basket of \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  including the dollar, the yen and the German mark. When the dollar advances against its major counterparts, the baht tends to decline. \par \par \uc2  (END) DOW JONES ASIAN EQUITIES REPORT 08-04-97 \par \par \uc2  1105GMT \par \par \uc2  1028 1861 \par \par \uc2 Dokument aer0000020011004dt480